ny other unlisted code) $\\rightarrow$ `np.nan`\n\n**Step 3: Write `vars/{variable_name}.py`**\n\nI will write the file now.\n*   `survey_id`: `eeq_2012`\n*   `variable_name`: `Q16`\n*   `standard_name`: `op_q16`\n*   `raw_name`: `Q16`\n*   `question_label`: \"Unknown question for Q16 - Inferred Categorical\"\n*   `type`: `categorical`\n\nI must also infer `mapped_value_labels` for the `CODEBOOK_VARIABLES` section.",
